WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
<b>His Girl Friday (1940)</b> — <i>Public Domain Preservation Edition</i>

2
00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:16.000
<b>Walter Burns:</b> Hildy, you can't quit the paper now—you're a newspaperman!

3
00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:26.000
<b>Hildy Johnson:</b> That's why I'm quitting, Walter! I want to go somewhere I can be a woman.

4
00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:38.000
<b>Walter Burns:</b> Give us just one more exclusive on the Earl Williams case and I'll buy you the train ticket myself!
